    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="25.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 25.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif ðiefefioh mon æt ciepan befo, ⁊ hit næbbe beforan godum weotum geceapod, gecyðe hit be wite, þæt he ne gewita ne gestala nære, oððe gielde to wite VI ⁊ XXX sciƚƚ.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If stolen property is found in the merchant’s possession, and he has not bought it in the presence of good witnesses, let him declare [with an oath] in the amount of the fine that he was neither accessory nor thief, or let him give as fine 6 and 30 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If stolen property in the hands of a trader is attached, and he has not bought it in the presence of trustworthy witnesses, he shall declare with an oath equal to the penalty [involved] that he has been neither an accessory nor an accomplice [to the theft], or pay a fine of 36 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif man forstolen feoh æt ceapmen befó, ⁊ hit næbbe beforan godum witum geceapod, gecyðe hit be wite, ðæt he na gewita ne gestala nære, oððe gilde to wite VI ⁊ XXX scll'.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
